text = "Okay so here is all the enemies but since I'm lazy I still haven't done this yet and like a











If you are reading this then this page is not finished yet, but here is relevant
info for the enemies.
Slimes - they move towards you. Black slime will speed up and increase damage
at half health.
Tarnishes - they move towards you. they will constantly regenerate lost health.
Robobots - they move towards you. They have defense which reduces incoming 
damage by a flat amount, down to 1 damage if the incoming damage is too low.
Mage - fires projectiles towards you. Projectiles deal same damage as their
contact damage.



also the return  button works so you can leave you aren't stuck here btw i just wanted to let you know and if you are reading this then wowowowow"

